  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With EAC coming up, features coming from the modding community are going to be unavailable. That includes features that help fight against non-client-modding hackers, and features that enhance accessibility.\nI can live without portable mirrors for a while, but people with disability might not be able to use VRChat anymore. Please make this the #1 priority.\n\nEDIT 2022/07/28\n--\nFollowing the announcement, I'm happy to hear accessibility has become the main focus. Though I hope a solution for deaf people is currently being designed as well.\n\nHowever, none of the security concerns have been addressed. Although EAC can help block crashing, hacking and ripping mods, please be aware that it will not block any hacking tools that are not client mods.",
